Use these pages as a lookup when you know what you need but want the exact API details. The [Guide](../02-guide/index) covers the same topics with more explanation.

- [Expressions](01-expressions): the full `Expression` API for searching, walking, transforming, and generating SQL
- [Dialects](02-dialects): how dialects work, tree-shaking, class-based vs string-based usage, and all 32 supported dialects
